      "id": "claim_2885122e030f44aa94ef239ab6c95887",
      "statement": "`ModelCallTimeoutMiddleware` uses `asyncio.wait_for` to convert a stalled model call into `ModelCallTimeoutError`, with a positive environment override or a 900-second default; `ModelErrorMiddleware` logs and classifies a model exception, stores the type and code in thread metadata when possible, and re-raises it unchanged.",
