      "id": "claim_1482b5d06feb4c38bec845505a2a9962",
      "statement": "When configured with a fallback model, `ModelFallbackMiddleware` alternates primary and fallback attempts for retryable transport, timeout, model, and selected provider-status errors, applies a jittered `(0, 5, 15, 30, 45)` backoff schedule, and normally returns a user-visible terminal outage `AIMessage` after transient attempts are exhausted.",
